// Operation Angle Grinder: the anthro Syndicate troopers are cut.
// Ruins and maint rooms still place these types, so instead of removing them (which would need map edits)
// each one takes the look and name of the regular Syndicate trooper it is built on.

/mob/living/basic/trooper/syndicate/melee/anthro
